# This file disables Jekyll processing on GitHub Pages so the site is
# served exactly as committed (index.html, 404.html + interop-data.js).
# 404.html stands in for the rewrite rules Pages does not have: it turns a
# deep link such as /c or /c-elixir into index.html?item=<slug> and leaves the
# address bar untouched, so the dashboard can restore the pretty path itself.
